1
00:00:00,462 --> 00:00:03,922
(Leonard:)...the dark matter signal found
in sodium-iodide crystals by the Italians.

2
00:00:04,091 --> 00:00:05,761
(Beverley:)So no original research?

3
00:00:06,635 --> 00:00:07,965
(Howard:)No.

4
00:00:08,136 --> 00:00:09,766
BEVERLY:
What's the point of my seeing it?

5
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:13,060
(Beverley:)I could just read the paper
the Italians wrote.

6
00:00:14,893 --> 00:00:18,523
Okay, just for the record, we're not
in an ersatz homosexual relationship.

7
00:00:18,689 --> 00:00:20,729
(Raj:)Well, then,
why didn't you say that to her?

8
00:00:20,899 --> 00:00:24,779
- Why is it always my responsibility?
- Oh, it's not always your responsibility.

9
00:00:24,945 --> 00:00:28,535
(Raj:)I swear, this is the same thing you did
at the comic book store last week.

10
00:00:31,952 --> 00:00:33,992
(Howard:)I can't believe you're bringing that up.

11
00:00:35,455 --> 00:00:39,085
- I didn't bring it up. You did.
- We'll talk about this later.

12
00:00:39,251 --> 00:00:42,501
Well, you always say that,
but we never do.

13
00:00:47,467 --> 00:00:50,257
(Sheldon:)You went to the comic book store
without me?

14
00:00:58,311 --> 00:01:00,021
- Hey.
- You got alcohol?

